                        <strong>Sign in required for live CP data.</strong>
                        Guest browse shows module chrome and PHP-reference actions only.
                        Digests stay empty until an admin session is present.
                        <a href="/cp/login" style="margin-left:.35rem;font-weight:700;color:#c2410c;">Sign in</a>
                    </div>
                }
                <div class="row">
